WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.980
An exciting life starts
with big questions.

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:03.540
Like...

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:05.720
Whoa! How fast was that shot?

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:07.420
That was powerful.

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:10.740
Whoa! How far did that ball go?

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:11.580
Nice!

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:15.060
Wait. You can take an ECG here?

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:16.700
And here too?

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.860
An ECG at a birthday party?

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:22.380
So, how did you sleep?

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:24.940
And why measure your blood oxygen?

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:28.020
Hmm. Now I get it.
